## Data

The IRS Statistics of Income annual extracts of Form 990 and Form 990-EZ financial data,
and the Exempt Organizations Business Master File. Works of the United States federal
government, in the public domain. The exact granting sentence for each is quoted in
[DATA-SOURCES.md](DATA-SOURCES.md).

No Snowflake Marketplace data is redistributed by this repository or served by the site.
Marketplace terms permit internal use only, so every per-organisation figure comes from the
public domain IRS download instead.

