## Code

Nothing is bundled into the browser. `public/` ships hand-written HTML, CSS and one
JavaScript module with no dependencies, and the Cloudflare Pages Functions under
`functions/` call the Gemini, ElevenLabs and Solana JSON APIs over `fetch` with no SDK.

One development dependency, never shipped to a visitor:

- `@solana/web3.js` 1.98.4, by Solana Labs. MIT. Used only by
  [`test/attest.wire.test.mjs`](test/attest.wire.test.mjs), to prove the transaction bytes
  this project builds by hand are identical to the ones the reference implementation
  produces, and by `tools/devnet.mjs` for a balance check.

The SPL Memo program id `MemoSq4gqABAXKb96qnH8TysNcWxMyWCqXgDLGmfcHr` is an on-chain
address, not code included here.

## Services

Google Gemini API, ElevenLabs API and the public Solana devnet RPC are called at runtime
under their own terms. ElevenLabs audio in this project was generated on a free-tier
account, which permits non-commercial use; Keepalive takes no money, processes no donation
and carries no advertising.

## AI assistance

AI assistance (Claude, Anthropic) was used in building this project. The design, the
analysis and the verification are the author's, and every figure published came out of SQL
in `data/` that can be rerun from the raw IRS files with `npm run data`.
